  "claim": "Pawnography, featuring Richard Corey Harrison, is filmed in the Gold & Silver Pawn Shop in Las Vegas.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Pawnography. Sentence: Hosted by comedian Christopher Titus and featuring \"Pawn Stars\" personalities Rick Harrison, Corey Harrison and Austin \"Chumlee\" Russell as panelists, the series features contestants answering questions for a chance to win cash and items for sale from the Gold and Silver Pawn Shop (where \"Pawn Stars\" is taped).\nPage: Corey Harrison. Sentence: Richard Corey \"Big Hoss\" Harrison (born April 27, 1983) is an American businessman and reality television personality, known as a cast member of the History TV series \"Pawn Stars\", which documents his work at the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop in Las Vegas, which he co-owns with his father, Rick Harrison, and grandfather, Richard Benjamin Harrison.",
