        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Titus, Rick Harrison, Corey Harrison, Austin \"Chumlee\" Russell, Richard Benjamin Harrison\n- TV Series: Pawnography, Pawn Stars\n- Places: Gold & Silver Pawn Shop, World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop, Las Vegas\n- Roles: comedian, panelists, contestants, businessman, reality television personality\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Corey \"Big Hoss\" Harrison was born on April 27, 1983.\n- Richard Corey \"Big Hoss\" Harrison is an American businessman and reality television personality.\n- Corey Harrison is known as a cast member of the History TV series \"Pawn Stars.\"\n- \"Pawn Stars\" documents Corey Harrison's work at the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop in Las Vegas.\n- Corey Harrison co-owns the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop with his father, Rick Harrison, and his grandfather, Richard Benjamin Harrison.\n- \"Pawnography\" is hosted by comedian Christopher Titus.\n- \"Pawnography\" features \"Pawn Stars\" personalities Rick Harrison, Corey Harrison, and Austin \"Chumlee\" Russell as panelists.\n- In \"Pawnography,\" contestants answer questions for a chance to win cash and items for sale from the Gold and Silver Pawn Shop.\n- \"Pawn Stars\" is taped at the Gold and Silver Pawn Shop.",
